[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629537205","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102333#issuecomment-2629537205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102333","id":2629537205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cu421","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-02T20:09:39Z","updated_at":"2025-02-02T20:10:20Z","body":"Seems like it works if you use `font.get_rids()[0]`\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/466a7c29-a133-4c63-82c8-1f24561ae23e)\n\n`Font::_get_rid()` is overridden to return an empty RID always: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f134769506d8ac2e3a9f676a10f5be81da1ded8b/scene/resources/font.h#L122\n\nPerhaps it could be updated to print an error, directing users to use the proper function? Or return the first RID and include a warning if multiple exist?\nAlso we could update CharFXTransform documentation to explain how to get a RID of a font properly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629537205/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629546214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102333#issuecomment-2629546214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102333","id":2629546214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cu7Dm","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-02T20:38:28Z","updated_at":"2025-02-02T20:38:28Z","body":"This value is intended to be read-only and should not be changed.\n\n`CharFX` is called after all text/font processing (shaping), and contain low-level data:\n- `char_fx.font` is a specific font `RID` not a `Font` class (which can contain multiple font RIDs for main font and fallbacks)\n-  the glyph index (and number of glyphs that represent a set of characters) is specific to the font RID, and therefore you can't simply change `font` and expect a correct result (it will display wrong glyphs).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629546214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629687986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102333#issuecomment-2629687986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102333","id":2629687986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cvdqy","user":{"login":"karmaral","id":39108635,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MTA4NjM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39108635?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral","html_url":"https://github.com/karmaral","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T01:15:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T01:15:51Z","body":"Oh, I see. So there's no good way of changing the font inside an effect then? \n\nI'm trying to have multiple weights in the same `RichTextLabel`. I ended up intercepting my original custom tag (which just adds color, and I wanted it to bolden the fonts as well) in the source text and adding a `[font]` tag inside.\n\nI'm curious, if this isn't supposed to be changed, why does RedMser soltion work? What are the risks of doing it this way? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2629687986/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2630030969","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102333#issuecomment-2630030969","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102333","id":2630030969,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cwxZ5","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T05:47:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T05:47:07Z","body":"> why does RedMser soltion work?\n\nThis can only work if fonts are almost identical (e.g., different variations of the same font, but there is no guarantee it will work even in this case).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2630030969/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2630571043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102333#issuecomment-2630571043","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102333","id":2630571043,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cy1Qj","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T10:39:40Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T10:42:14Z","body":"For the reference, it's working like this:\n\nLet's say you have an \"āfii\" string, it is processed by a text server which does various things like BiDi and contextual substitution and output array of glyphs and coordinates for them. Glyphs have arbitrary and specific to font indices, and font can compose them in different ways. One font can have `ā` as a single glyph, and another can have two glyphs for base `a` and `_`, \"ffi\" can be composed from 3 glyph or be a single ligature glyph, so for this string you can get 2 glyphs or 5. CharFX is called for this processed glyph array, so substituting the font is not straightforward (you can do something if it is at least the same number, but you can't replace 2 glyphs with 5, and you won't get information about all glyphs in advance).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2630571043/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635091193","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102333#issuecomment-2635091193","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102333","id":2635091193,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dEEz5","user":{"login":"karmaral","id":39108635,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MTA4NjM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39108635?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral","html_url":"https://github.com/karmaral","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karmaral/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T21:14:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T21:14:16Z","body":"I'm not that familiar with those systems but I think I understand, yeah. I do believe it's a much more rarer case to want to use a different font family inside the same RichTextLabel than to use different weights, even though the latter is sort of edge already. It'd be nice to have a bit of creative freedom in that regard nevertheless.\n\nSo, even if I were to use this and it would work, would your PR make this workaround not possible in the next version?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635091193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981181104","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102333#issuecomment-2981181104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102333","id":2981181104,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xsTaw","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T17:18:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T17:18:48Z","body":"I believe this has been closed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102342 ?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981181104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]